sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client
    participant Appointment
    participant Patient
    participant Availability
    participant Notification
    Client->>Appointment: POST appointment + Idempotency-Key
    Appointment->>Appointment: Claim key + fingerprint atomically
    Appointment->>Patient: GET patient
    Patient-->>Appointment: Patient status
    Appointment->>Availability: POST reserve slot
    Availability->>Availability: Atomic capacity-checked DB update
    Availability-->>Appointment: Reservation result
    Appointment->>Appointment: Persist appointment and replay response
    Appointment->>Notification: POST mock notification (timeout + bounded retries)
    alt Notification succeeds
        Notification-->>Appointment: SENT
    else Notification unavailable
        Notification-->>Appointment: Failure/timeout
        Appointment->>Appointment: Keep confirmed booking; record notification failure
    end
    Appointment-->>Client: Booking result
